# Project Rules and Context

## Responsive Design Breakpoints

**Important**: In general, mobile design begins at the lg breakpoint (1024px). This means:
- Styles below `@screen-lg` (1024px) are for mobile/tablet
- Styles at `@screen-lg` and above are for desktop/large screens
- When making responsive changes, preserve mobile/tablet layouts and only modify desktop layouts

## Breakpoints Reference
- `@screen-sm`: 640px
- `@screen-md`: 768px  
- `@screen-lg`: 1024px (desktop starts here)
- `@screen-xl`: 1280px